{"seq":3,"slug":"contact-soft-shadows","title":"接触与软阴影","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-lighting-global-illumination/shadows/contact-soft-shadows","wordCount":1335,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"接触与软阴影\">接触与软阴影</h1><p>把手掌平贴在桌面上，指尖与桌子接触的那条缝里，阴影又黑又锐；手掌抬高几厘米，影子立刻变淡变糊，边缘晕开。同一只手，阴影的软硬随它离桌面的距离连续变化——这是真实世界里光源有面积（本影、半影）的必然结果，也是 <a href=\"shadow-mapping\">阴影贴图</a> 那种二值硬阴影永远做不到的。这一节讲两件事：让阴影边缘随距离物理地变软（软阴影），以及让物体落地处那条又细又黑的缝重新出现（接触阴影）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-本影-半影与遮挡距离\">核心概念：本影、半影与遮挡距离</h2><p>理想点光源只产生本影（要么全黑要么全亮），所以阴影是硬的。真实光源有面积，于是从接收点望向光源，光源被遮挡物挡住的比例是连续的——全挡是本影，部分挡是半影。半影的宽度由相似三角形决定，正比于光源大小和「遮挡物到接收面的距离」，反比于光源到接收面的距离：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{penumbra} \\propto \\frac{(d_{receiver} - d_{blocker})\\cdot w_{light}}{d_{blocker}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mb</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.263em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ece</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这就是为什么手贴着桌子时影子硬（遮挡距离近，半影窄），抬高后影子软（遮挡距离远，半影宽）。所有物理软阴影技术，核心都是去估这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{blocker}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，再据此决定模糊半径。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[面光源] --&gt; B[遮挡物]&#10;  B --&gt; C[接收面着色点]&#10;  C --&gt; D[第一步: 遮挡物搜索&lt;br/&gt;估平均 d_blocker]&#10;  D --&gt; E[第二步: 据相似三角形&lt;br/&gt;算半影宽度]&#10;  E --&gt; F[第三步: PCF 用该宽度&lt;br/&gt;做可变核滤波]&#10;  F --&gt; G[软阴影: 近硬远软]\">flowchart TD\n  A[面光源] --&gt; B[遮挡物]\n  B --&gt; C[接收面着色点]\n  C --&gt; D[第一步: 遮挡物搜索&lt;br/&gt;估平均 d_blocker]\n  D --&gt; E[第二步: 据相似三角形&lt;br/&gt;算半影宽度]\n  E --&gt; F[第三步: PCF 用该宽度&lt;br/&gt;做可变核滤波]\n  F --&gt; G[软阴影: 近硬远软]</pre><h2 id=\"pcss-把半影宽度算出来\">PCSS：把半影宽度算出来</h2><p>PCSS（Percentage-Closer Soft Shadows）是把上面三步直接落到 shadow map 上的经典方法。第一步「遮挡物搜索」：在 shadow map 上以接收点为中心采样一片区域，找出所有比接收点近的纹素，平均出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{blocker}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。第二步据相似三角形公式算出半影宽度。第三步用这个宽度作为 <a href=\"shadow-mapping\">阴影贴图</a> 里讲的 PCF 核大小，做一次可变半径的滤波。</p>\n<p>PCSS 的好处是物理直觉正确、近硬远软自动成立；代价有两个：遮挡物搜索阶段要采样一大片纹素，开销随半影变大而暴涨；以及大半径下采样数有限会产生噪声或带状。下表对比几种软阴影路线：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>半影是否随距离变</th>\n<th>主要代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定 PCF</td>\n<td>否（恒定宽度）</td>\n<td>便宜但不物理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PCSS</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>遮挡物搜索开销大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方差类 (VSM/MSM)</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>漏光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光追面光源阴影</td>\n<td>是（最准）</td>\n<td>需 RT 核 + 降噪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"接触阴影-屏幕空间补的最后一厘米\">接触阴影：屏幕空间补的最后一厘米</h2><p>shadow map 分辨率有限，加上偏移（bias）调参，物体与地面接触的那条极细的缝往往丢失——物体看起来在「飘」，这正是 <a href=\"cascaded-shadows\">级联阴影</a> 里彼得潘效应的延续。接触阴影（contact shadows，又叫屏幕空间阴影）用一个完全不同的招数补这一厘米：在屏幕空间里，从每个像素沿光源方向用深度缓冲做一小段光线步进（ray march），若撞到更近的深度，就判定被遮挡。</p>\n<p>因为它工作在屏幕空间、只走很短一段，所以极廉价，且分辨率等于屏幕分辨率，能抓住 shadow map 抓不住的精细落地缝、褶皱、小物件自阴影。它的局限也来自屏幕空间：只能遮挡屏幕上可见的几何，屏幕外或被遮挡的物体投不出接触阴影，步进太长又会变贵。所以它从不单独用，而是叠在 CSM 之上——CSM 管大轮廓，接触阴影补近处细节，这是 2026 年主流引擎（含 Unreal 的 Contact Shadows、各家屏幕空间阴影）的标准搭配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"硬件光追阴影-面光源的物理解\">硬件光追阴影：面光源的物理解</h2><p>当机器有 RT 核时，最干净的软阴影是直接对面光源采样：从着色点向光源面积内随机投若干条阴影光线，统计命中遮挡物的比例，就是真实的半影覆盖率，无需遮挡物搜索的近似。它天然正确、无漏光、不依赖屏幕空间。唯一的敌人是噪声——每像素只投几根光线远不够收敛，必须配空间-时间联合降噪器（denoiser），把稀疏采样在多帧间累积、滤波成干净结果。这又回到 <a href=\"../foundations/why-gi-hard\">为何全局光照困难</a> 里那个时间一致性的老问题：降噪器做不好，软阴影就会在运动中沸腾。2026 年 Unreal 的 Ray Traced Shadows 与 MegaLights 的阴影正是走这条路（来源：<a href=\"https://www.pcgamer.com/hardware/Unreal-Engine-5-5-Mega-Lights/\">PC Gamer 对 UE5.5 MegaLights 的报道</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>软阴影源于面光源：半影宽度正比于光源大小与遮挡距离，这是「近硬远软」的物理根源。</li>\n<li>PCSS 三步——遮挡物搜索估 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{blocker}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、算半影宽、可变核 PCF——是经典软阴影方案。</li>\n<li>接触阴影用屏幕空间短距光线步进，廉价补回 shadow map 丢失的落地细节，叠在 CSM 之上。</li>\n<li>硬件光追对面光源采样得到物理正确软阴影，代价是噪声，必须配降噪器。</li>\n<li>所有软阴影最终都要面对时间一致性：稳不住就会在运动中沸腾。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章 <a href=\"shadow-mapping\">阴影贴图</a>：PCSS 第三步复用其 PCF 滤波。</li>\n<li>同章 <a href=\"cascaded-shadows\">级联阴影</a>：接触阴影补 CSM 顾不到的近景落地。</li>\n<li>同库 <a href=\"../foundations/why-gi-hard\">为何全局光照困难</a>：光追软阴影的降噪即时间一致性难题。</li>\n<li>跨库 <a href=\"../../game-graphics/lighting-and-shadow/shadow-techniques\">游戏图形 · 阴影技术</a>：阴影算法的管线全景。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"接触与软阴影","id":"接触与软阴影"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：本影、半影与遮挡距离","id":"核心概念-本影-半影与遮挡距离"},{"level":2,"text":"PCSS：把半影宽度算出来","id":"pcss-把半影宽度算出来"},{"level":2,"text":"接触阴影：屏幕空间补的最后一厘米","id":"接触阴影-屏幕空间补的最后一厘米"},{"level":2,"text":"硬件光追阴影：面光源的物理解","id":"硬件光追阴影-面光源的物理解"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"级联阴影","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-lighting-global-illumination/shadows/cascaded-shadows"},"next":{"title":"烘焙光照贴图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-lighting-global-illumination/global-illumination/baked-lightmaps"}}